## 9. Review Outcome

The team agreed that targeted recommendations will apply only to High Risk predictions. Low Risk predictions will receive routine check-in guidance without threshold-based recommendations.

The remaining thresholds, function contract, display decisions and integration responsibilities remain draft proposals until the team completes the review table.

